### Extract with StaticHtml Adapter
POST https://localhost:5001/api/adapters/static-html/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "method": "GET",
  "headers": {
    "User-Agent": "Ghost.Sdk.Spider/1.0"
  },
  "timeout": "00:00:30"
}

###

### Extract with Custom Options
POST https://localhost:5001/api/adapters/static-html/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.wikipedia.org",
  "method": "GET",
  "options": {
    "timeout": "00:01:00",
    "followRedirects": true,
    "maxRedirects": 10,
    "enableCaching": true,
    "cacheTtl": "00:05:00"
  }
}

###

### Test Adapter Availability
GET https://localhost:5001/api/adapters/static-html/status
Accept: application/json

###

### Extract with Proxy
POST https://localhost:5001/api/adapters/static-html/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://ipinfo.io/json",
  "method": "GET",
  "options": {
    "proxyUrl": "http://proxy.example.com:8080",
    "timeout": "00:00:30"
  }
}

###
